 are some tips:\r\n\r\n1. Choose an activity you enjoy\r\n2. Set realistic goals\r\n3. Start with short, frequent workouts\r\n4. Increase the intensity and duration of your workouts gradually\r\n\r\nMore information at [Centers for Disease Control and Prevention]( https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/benefits/ ).", "created_at": "2026-05-28T09:26:07.730Z"}}, {"model": "core.note", "pk": 15, "fields": {"task": 16, "author": 1, "content": "Exam preparation checklist:\r\n\r\n- Review normalization examples before exam\r\n- Practice SQL JOIN queries from lecture 8\r\n- Revise indexing and query optimization\r\n- Check ER diagram notation one more time\r\n- Focus on transaction management and ACID properties\r\n- Redo old exam set from Spring 2024\r\n- Practice GROUP BY and aggregate functions\r\n- Revise differences between DELETE, DROP and TRUNCATE\r\n- Prepare examples of many-to-many relationships\r\n- Review PostgreSQL setup before submission\r\n- Look through lecture slides on concurrency control\r\n- Practice writing migration scripts in Django\r\n- Check if all seed data loads correctly", "created_at": "2026-05-28T09:31:39.060Z"}}, {"model": "core.note", "pk": 16, "fields": {"task": 11, "author": 1, "content": "Contact form\r\nMake an HTML document with a contact form for a Volkswagen dealer containing the following fields:\r\n\r\nName: mandatory\r\n\r\nEmail address: mandatory\r\n\r\nDepartment: mandatory, a drop-down menu with the following choices: Audi, Volkswagen, Skoda, Seat\r\n\r\nSubject: optional\r\n\r\nMessage: mandatory, at least 5 visible lines\r\n\r\nAdd a submit button labelled Send in the form.\r\n\r\nGive the fields proper names. Submit the form data to https://req.73bits.com/ and use the shown output to verify that your form works correctly. Make your own assumptions if necessary.\r\n\r\nValidate your HTML document with the HTML validator at https://validator.w3.org.\r\n\r\nExtra challenge: Allow the user to attach a file.", "created_at": "2026-05-28T09:43:13.219Z"}}, {"model": "core.note", "pk": 18, "fields": {"task": 10, "author": 4, "content": "-", "created_at": "2026-05-28T12:48:17.412Z"}}, {"model": "core.note", "pk": 19, "fields": {"task": 10, "author": 5, "content": "-", "created_at": "2026-05-28T13:52:19.588Z"}}, {"model": "core.personalnote", "pk": 1, "fields": {"author": 5, "course": 5, "title": "Database lecture notes week 1", "content": "-", "created_at": "2026-05-28T14:02:14.543Z"}}, {"model": "core.personalnote", "pk": 2, "fields": {"author": 5, "course": 1, "title": "Database project notes", "content": "-", "created_at": "2026-05-28T14:03:02.853Z"}}, {"model": "core.personalnote", "pk": 3, "fields": {"author": 4, "course": 1, "title": "Lecture notes", "content": "-", "created_at": "2026-05-28T14:03:56.402Z"}}]
